1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:00,829
Claude Sheets,

2
00:00:00,839 --> 00:00:02,355
2026 beta spreadsheet:

3
00:00:02,365 --> 00:00:03,542
you think checking AI math

4
00:00:03,552 --> 00:00:04,559
will cost you a redo,

5
00:00:04,569 --> 00:00:06,095
but actually formulas show how.

6
00:00:06,345 --> 00:00:07,059
Here's how:

7
00:00:07,254 --> 00:00:08,362
a math teacher's rule...

8
00:00:08,548 --> 00:00:09,339
show your work,

9
00:00:09,543 --> 00:00:11,018
so mistakes can show!

10
00:00:11,268 --> 00:00:12,808
Before, in our example,

11
00:00:12,818 --> 00:00:14,136
you pasted Claude's chat

12
00:00:14,146 --> 00:00:15,907
budget into another tool

13
00:00:15,917 --> 00:00:16,571
as plain text:

14
00:00:16,581 --> 00:00:17,235
three totals,

15
00:00:17,245 --> 00:00:17,909
no work shown.

16
00:00:18,159 --> 00:00:19,565
Checking meant redoing the math;

17
00:00:19,841 --> 00:00:21,102
Claude, outside that tool,

18
00:00:21,112 --> 00:00:22,637
couldn't follow your edits.

19
00:00:22,887 --> 00:00:25,612
Now, in the paid-plan beta,

20
00:00:25,622 --> 00:00:26,856
it stays in Claude;

21
00:00:26,866 --> 00:00:29,043
